ve near, AV.;\n (perf. 1. pl. -चक्रिमा॑) to serve or prepare a sacrifice to (dat.), RV. iv, 17, 18;\n (impf. आकरोत्) to call near (a deity), MBh. v, 426 :\nCaus. -कारयति, to call near, invite to a place, MBh. iii, 15546 seq.; Pañcat.; Daś.;\nto ask any one (acc.) for anything (acc.), R. ii, 13, 2 :\nDesid. -चिकीर्षति, to intend to accomplish, Daś. :\nIntens. p. -च॑रिक्रत्, attracting repeatedly towards one's self, AV. xi, 5, 6.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(Caus. -कारयति, also) to imply by signs, Divyāv.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "AkF", "headword": "आकॄ", "headword_slp1": "AkF", "fold": "akf", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आ-√ कॄ (2. sg. Subj. -किरा॑सि and Impv. -किरा; p. f. -किर॑न्ती) to scatter or sprinkle over, give abundantly, RV. viii, 49, 4 and ix, 81, 3; AV. iv, 38, 2.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "akfti": [{"id": "Akfti", "headword": "आकृति", "headword_slp1": "Akfti", "fold": "akfti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आ॑-कृति f. a constituent part, RV. x, 85, 5 (cf. द्वा॑दशाकृति)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "form, figure, shape, appearance, aspect, KātyŚr.; ŚvetUp.; Mn. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a well-formed shape, VarBṛS.; Mṛcch.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "kind, species, Suśr.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "specimen, RPrāt.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a metre (consisting of four lines with twenty-two syllables each), RPrāt. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(hence in arithm.) the number twenty-two", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "आ॑-कृति m. N. of a prince, MBh. ii, 126 and 1165 (v.l. आं-कृति).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आकृतिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AkftiH"]}, {"id": "AkftI", "headword": "आकृती", "headword_slp1": "AkftI", "fold": "akfti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आ-कृती f. (metrically for आकृति) form, shape, MBh. xv, 698.", "gloss