; Inf. -क्रष्टुम्, Kum. ii, 59)\nto draw towards one's self, attract, draw away with one's self, MBh. &c.;\nto draw (a sword), Mṛcch.; Vet. &c.;\nto bend (a bow), Daś.; Śiś. ix, 40;\nto take off (as a garment, &c.), MBh. ii, 2291; Mṛcch.;\nto draw out of (abl.), Vet. &c.;\nto withdraw, deprive of, take away, MBh. i, 6348; Bhaṭṭ. (fut. 1. sg. आ-कर्क्ष्यामि), Kathās.;\nto borrow from (abl.), Hit.; Pāṇ. iii, 1, 106; Siddh. :\nCaus. (p. f. -कर्षयन्ती) to draw near to one's self.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "akfswi": [{"id": "Akfzwi", "headword": "आकृष्टि", "headword_slp1": "Akfzwi", "fold": "akfswi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आ-कृष्टि f. attracting, drawing towards one's self (as of the bow-string in bending the bow), Kap. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(in Tāntric texts) attracting of an absent person into one's presence (by a magic formula), also the formula (मन्त्र) used for this purpose.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आकृष्टिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AkfzwiH"]}], "akfswimantra": [{"id": "Akfzwimantra", "headword": "आकृष्टिमन्त्र", "headword_slp1": "Akfzwimantra", "fold": "akfswimantra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आ-कृष्टि—मन्त्र m. the above formula, Hit.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आकृष्टिमन्त्रः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AkfzwimantraH"]}], "akfswiman": [{"id": "Akfzwiman", "headword": "आकृष्टिमन्", "headword_slp1": "Akfzwiman", "fold": "akfswiman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आकृष्टिमन् m. the being आ-कृष्ट, (g. दृढादि [Kāś.] q.v.)", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "akfswya": [{"id": "Akfzwya", "headword": "आकृष्ट्य", "headword_slp1": "Akfzwya", "fold": "akfswya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "आकृष्ट्य n. id., ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}]}